# "Loses all abilities" (CR 613.1f) applied after the grant takes the granted static ability with the rest, and its effect stops:
# on turn 3 Bot1 bolts Ms. Marvel (base power 3, the three cards in hand after the draw), then casts The Wondrous Wasp, whose
# enters ability taps her and strips her of every ability for as long as the Wasp stays. With two cards in hand she is a plain
# 1/4 with no reach or vigilance, not a 2/4: the hand no longer sets her power. (The Wasp's ability is not a spell, so it does not
# trigger her either.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mox Pearl
The Wondrous Wasp
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

